%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI know Asami won't come back to me...\d%K%P
「麻实她，已经不会再回来了…」%K%P
I took a step back, as always.%K%P
果然，令人畏缩。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dSo... does that mean you want her to come back?\d%K%P
「那个…\n也就是说，你还是期望她能回来吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dNo. It just means she won't.\d%K%P
「不是。\n我是说，她不会回来了」%K%P
I couldn't possibly move forward. I couldn't look down the\nsame pit I once shoved a loved one into.%K%P
前行，不可能做到。\n我不愿回想起，曾亲手将爱人推下深渊的痛苦回忆。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dWe're not asking for your predictions.\nWe want to know how -you- feel.\d%K%P
「我们问的不是理君的猜测啊。\n问的是你真正的心意啊…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhat's the point in asking me that? All this time, I've\ndone nothing but cause her pain.\d%K%P
「那我该说些什么好呢？\n我，直到如今，都在伤害着麻实啊？」%K%P
I was not strong enough to believe that she was still\nholding onto the side of that cliff, waiting for my help.%K%P
她正命悬一线，孤苦无依，\n还在期待我能回到她身边么？\n我还没有顽强到相信这种天方夜谭式幻想的程度。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI was blind to Asami's pain, forcing all the decisions on\nher... I made her shoulder everything...! Khehh, khohh...\nkhehh, khohh... uh, hahh, phwahh...\d%K%P
「我没有察觉到麻实的苦衷，全都让她做了主张，\n让她背负起了一切…！？\n咳咳、咳咳…咳咳、咳咳…呜、呼、呼呼…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dOsamu... are you okay?\d%K%P
「理君…没事儿吧？」%K%P
I swallowed a whole mouthful of Ms. Kaya's favorite\nscotch.%K%P
我把夏夜小姐中意的苏格兰威士忌酒，\n生生地灌进了胃里。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAnd even after we reunited, all I could think about was\nmyself.\d%K%P
「就算是重逢了，我也是一直自私自利，对她漠不关心」%K%P
The burning, bitter taste filling my throat caused an\nonset of coughs as I struggled to breathe. Even my eyes\nteared up a bit.%K%P
灼热的烧酒，让我剧烈地咳了出来，\n痛苦不堪，喘不上气…我的眼眶里，也充满了泪水。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dShe'd always be the first to help and console me if\nanything happened, regardless of her own circumstances...\nShe'd accept me without even asking for an explanation.\d%K%P
「我有了什么麻烦，她总是放下自己的一切，\n和我谈心，安慰着我…\n明明我什么也没对她说，她却接受了我…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dOsamu...\d%K%P
「理先生…」%K%P
Indeed...%K%P
是啊…%K%P
I never voiced my honest feelings towards her. Not even as\nI held her naked body in my arms.%K%P
和麻实相拥的时候…\n我一次都没有，把自己的真情实感倾诉于她。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAnd now you want me to say that I still love her?!\d%K%P
「事到如今，这样的我，\n还能够坦然地说出『果然还是爱着麻实』吗？」%K%P
Me, who would always hide behind comments on her scent or\nhow her presence was soothing?%K%P
只是，『安心』，还有那份『熟悉的气味』…%K%P
Unsure of who or what I wanted myself, I approached Asami\nwith ambiguity, secretly expecting her not to reject me.%K%P
不明白自己在追求着谁，\n明知她不会拒绝，却和她保持着暧昧，如此卑鄙地打着小算盘。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou think I can just ask her to come back to me because I\nsuddenly realized I'm unable to let go of her?!\d%K%P
「就算无法割舍感情，夫妇二人破镜重圆…\n你觉得她有可能就这么原谅我吗！？」%K%P
Damn... the alcohol must've gone to my head.\nI was going on about things I should've kept to myself.%K%P
果真是…一发不可收拾。\n隐藏在心中的话，滔滔不绝地说了出口。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dUgh... I-I'm sorry for raising my voice...\d%K%P
「啊…呜…抱、抱歉，我心情不太好」%K%P
The bitterness of the drink made me shed tear after tear,\nall the while knowing I really shouldn't have.%K%P
酒入愁肠，令人难以忍受，\n强忍着的泪水，也渐渐地流了出来。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dBut Osamu...\d%K%P
「可是啊，理君…」%K%P
Ms. Kaya slowly leaned closer to my ear as she stroked my\nback soothingly.%K%P
夏夜小姐一边轻抚着我的后背，\n一边慢慢地在我的耳边轻声低语。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dSorry if I sound too presumptuous, but isn't that\nsomething Teach should be deciding for herself?\d%K%P
「虽然把话挑明有些伤人，\n但到头来，还是要靠老师自己来判断吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThat's right. And she did.\nShe said we cannot go back to how we used to be.\d%K%P
「是的吧？于是，麻实已经判断过了。\n我们也已经，不会再回到从前了」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dIs that really what she said?\d%K%P
「夫人是这么说的？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYes, and with quite an emphasis. I doubt there's too many\nmen out there who divorced their wives twice...\d%K%P
「嗯～、她之前对我说过。\n不会再度和分道扬镳的男人在一起了～。\n呜…呼呼…噗」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d\dIt felt good, but it's too addictive.\nI think it's about time we put a stop to this.\d\d%K%P
『虽然很开心…虽然再次耽溺于其中了…\n但也差不多得停下了』%K%P
Our bodies fit each other like puzzle pieces, yet our\nhearts were miles apart.%K%P
明明身体还是那样相融，\n但为什么，我们的心却相隔着千里之遥…%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dSo what are you planning to do?\d%K%P
「那，你打算怎么办？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhat is there to do?\nI won't do anything. I mean, there's nothing I -can- do.\d%K%P
「没什么怎么办不怎么办的。\n我什么也不会做。因为，我什么都做不到」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dAre you satisfied with that, Osamu?\d%K%P
「这样真的好吗？理君」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIt's not a matter of satisfaction!\nThere's just no meaning in attempting things I can't do!\d%K%P
「无所谓好坏了。\n做不到的事情，做了也没有任何意义！」%K%P
I felt the alcohol spread across my body.%K%P
我的醉意渐渐浓重。%K%P
As I struggled with increasingly blurry vision and a surge\nof dizziness, the emotions I kept locked inside my heart\nbegan to spill forth. Each breath I exhaled reeked of\nbooze.%K%P
脑海中天旋地转。\n压抑了很久的感情，和烂醉如泥的气息一起，肆无忌惮地散发出来。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dSorry, but I'm not buying it.\d%K%P
「真是难以置信啊～」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhat do you mean? Why...?\nWhy do all of you care so much about a pathetic man like\nme...\d%K%P
「什么啊，为什么啊…\n大家，要对我这样，没用的…男人…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dWell, let's just say we're already familiar with your\nM.O.\d%K%P
「因为我们…\n都太了解芳村理的为人了啊？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Eh?\d%K%P
「…诶」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dTenacious, thoroughly prepared, and aggressive... You\nbring battles doomed to end in defeat to a draw. And you\ntaught us both to never give up.\d%K%P
「坚韧不拔，准备周到，不屈不挠…\n就算是会一败涂地的战斗也能和对方打得难分难解，\n有着绝对不会输的卑鄙才能哦？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dTo... never give up?\d%K%P
「绝对、不会输…」%K%P
Now that I thought about it...%K%P
这么说…%K%P
One of my old co-workers made fun of me as a genius who\nbrings a mercy-rule loss to a cancelled game.%K%P
以前，我的同事经常用\n『让５回必败的棒球比赛，都因为降雨而取消的天才』\n这句话拿我开玩笑啊…%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dOsamu... if this was a bid with zero possibility of\nsuccess, would you still give up that easily?\d%K%P
「呐，理先生…\n若是有一个『胜率为０％的竞标』，\n你会就那么简单放弃吗？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI get the feeling he'd buy out the opposing company\nbefore he let that happen.\d%K%P
「他会收购投标公司，\n进行强行投标的吧」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhat merit is there in an action like that?\d%K%P
「那种行为有什么好处啊…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dWell... it might decide whether or not you get to reclaim\nsomething that belonged to you.\d%K%P
「是啊…\n对于属于自己的东西，还想再得到一次？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dIt offers you more self-satisfaction than anything else.\d%K%P
「那可是那可是…\n太沉浸于自我满足了，真是」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
To regain what I had lost...%K%P
属于自己的东西，\n再一次得到…%K%P
Although my acts stemmed from a desire for self-\nsatisfaction, this battle of trying to return minus to\nzero...%K%P
这种行为，不过是为了满足自己。\n为了把直到如今的种种灰暗，全部归零的这场战斗…%K%P
...would surely test my mettle and present a host of fresh\ndangers. But that didn't make it an impossible venture\ndoomed to fail.%K%P
说不定，是非常珍贵，\n虽然饱含了各种苦难，但胜利的可能性也不是并不存在。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dBut... why are you trying to console me?\nEven I realize how much of a pathetic, worthless man I\nam...\d%K%P
「为什么要这么…\n你们，为什么要鼓励这么没用又差劲的我啊…」%K%P
I was growing increasingly drowsy.%K%P
所以，我有些困了。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dIt's not like we had any real obligation to help.\nI guess we just felt like it.\d%K%P
「确实没有帮助你的道理。\n嘛，不知不觉就这样了」%K%P
I felt like I could finally have a peaceful night's sleep.\nNo nightmares, no jumping out of bed in cold sweat.%K%P
现在，也许我不会再做噩梦了。\n就算关掉了灯，也许我也不会惊恐地尖叫了。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dListen, I'm just looking out for my subordinate's well-\nbeing as an executive. It's an important duty of ours.\d%K%P
「对我来说，要时时留意部下的心理监控，\n最近，这也成了上司一项重要的任务了，考虑到这种风潮…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...I know.\d%K%P
「………嗯」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dBoth the princess and myself are still in love with you,\nso we want you to be happy, if possible.\d%K%P
「不管是我，还是公主，现在都还是喜欢理君的啊。\n至少，想让他获得幸福…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dDon't use present tense here!\nIt makes it sound like I'm a sore loser or something!\d%K%P
「不要用现在进行时说这句话啊！\n这么一说，我岂不成了纠缠不休的情场败犬么！」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dThere are two ways of getting Teach back, Osamu -- one is\nto use your endurance and technique to make her remember\nthe taste of your you-know-what.\d%K%P
「和老师复合的方法有两个啊…\n第一个，让理君用体力与技巧，\n使她回忆起理君的阳刚之气…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dYou really have no restraints at all, do you?\d%K%P
「你这一开始就说的什么玩意儿啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dRemember the look on Teach's face when she talked about\nhow much she loved it? I personally think it'd be quite\neffective.\d%K%P
「可是，老师不是真的很爱他吗？\n我想这个方法可能有效啊」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dI'm pretty sure she was talking about their\ncompatibility, not Osamu's individual prowess at...\nAaaaaah! I ended up imagining it again!\d%K%P
「不是吧…\n那与其说是她和理先生的相性好，不如说他本来就很厉害…\n哎，啊啊啊啊啊！又开始脑补了！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dThe second one... would be eliminating what she thinks is\nher handicap.\d%K%P
「第二个…嘛。\n将她认为阻挡在二人之间的障碍，消为无形」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dHow?\d%K%P
「怎么办？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dIt'd be solved if they had a child.\d%K%P
「两个人有个孩子就好了」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dBut it's precisely because she can't have one that...\d%K%P
「可是，那对她来说做不到啊…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dWell, in other words... Ah.\d%K%P
「也就是说………啊」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dWhat? What's wrong?\d%K%P
「葫芦里卖的什么药啊？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dShhh!\d%K%P
「嘘～！」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dHuh?\d%K%P
「哎…？」%K%P
