%LC理
\dNmm... mhm...\d%K%P
「嗯…嗯～…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dHaha, he looks so cute.\d%K%P
「呼呼…好～可爱」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dI doubt that's something you should be saying about a man\nseveral years older than you...\d%K%P
