%LC姫绪
\d...Osamu.\d%K%P
「啊…理、先生…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dWhat are you getting all red for?\nI thought you'd already given up on him.\d%K%P
「你害羞个什么劲儿啊？\n果然还没放弃么？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dI-I never... said that...!\d%K%P
「谁、谁也………那种事…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
