%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dOh? Really?\nSo you're saying you could actually do it if you won?\d%K%P
「嘿～…是吗？\n那赢的人一定要做哦？膝枕…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dUgh...!\d%K%P
「呜…啊！？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dIt's okay. You can have that.\nBut in exchange, I'll be taking his arm as a pillow for\nmyself.\d%K%P
